      "text": "Steps (call order):\n 1  Learner selects a PDF to upload\n 2  App uploads the raw PDF to pdf-uploads/{user_id}/{document_id}/source.pdf\n 3  App inserts a documents row (status: processing)\n 4  App invokes extract-pdf(documentId)\n 5  extract-pdf reads the raw PDF\n 6  extract-pdf writes downscaled/recompressed extracted images\n 7  extract-pdf writes pages + document_images; status: extracted (or failed + error_code)\n 8  App shows the extraction result / error\n 9  Learner picks composition (and, on BYOK, provider + model from the catalog)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps (call order):\n 1  Learner selects a PDF to upload\n 2  App uploads the raw PDF to pdf-uploads/{user_id}/{document_id}/source.pdf\n 3  App inserts a documents row (status: processing)\n 4  App invokes extract-pdf(documentId)\n 5  extract-pdf reads the raw PDF\n 6  extract-pdf writes downscaled/recompressed extracted images\n 7  extract-pdf writes pages + document_images; status: extracted (or failed + error_code)\n 8  App shows the extraction result / error\n 9  Learner picks composition (and, on BYOK, provider + model from the catalog)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
