      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "10  App invokes generate-lesson(documentId, composition, provider?, model?)\n11  Reads plan flags; routes the key source (BYOK key via Vault RPC, or\n     platform key + rate-limit slot); reads document pages/images\n12  generateObject — structured slide deck (plus vision fallback)\n13  Inserts the lessons row (user_id = auth.uid())\n14  Returns the generated lesson or a typed error code\n15  Learner plays the lesson; answers activities (in-session state only)\n16  App inserts a lesson_attempts row with the final score (once per session)\n17  App shows the results summary; retake starts a fresh attempt",
      "textAlign": "left",
